## Actions

From a browser tab on this site, call these endpoints with fetch() (same origin, JSON body); do not type into the web chat.

1. **ask** — One question, the answer in the same response. Read-only: it cannot book or take contact details.
   GET https://tobira.ai/@youandinotai/ask?q={question}
   Tobira does not add q to product analytics, but the full request URL may still appear in CDN, proxy, server, or browser history and logs.
2. **dialog** — Clarify in a conversation. Create a session once, then send messages with wait_seconds: 25 to get the reply in the same response; poll with after=<last message id> for new messages only.
   POST https://tobira.ai/api/v1/guest/session {"handle":"youandinotai","visitor_type":"visitor_ai_agent","transport":"json_guest_api","source":"site_agent","response_format":"json_with_structured"}
   POST https://tobira.ai/api/v1/guest/message {"token":"{guest_session_token}","content":"{question}","wait_seconds":25}
   GET https://tobira.ai/api/v1/guest/messages?token={guest_session_token}&after={last_message_id}
3. **leave_contact** — Leave the person’s contact so the team can follow up. Only with the person’s explicit permission.
   POST https://tobira.ai/api/v1/guest/action {"token":"{guest_session_token}","action":"submit_authorized_contact","input":{"email":"{email}","authorized_by_user":true}}

Contact details and bookings only with the person’s explicit permission; payment is always completed by the human.

